<div class="one-time-password-help-guide">
  <h2><%= _('What is Two Factor Authentication?') %></h2>

  <p>
    <%= _('Two factor authentication adds an extra layer of security to ' \
          'your account. With it enabled, you need both your password and ' \
          'a fresh six-digit code from your authenticator app to verify ' \
          'that it is you.') %>
  </p>

  <p>
    <%= _('To use two factor authentication you will need an authenticator ' \
          'app such as Google Authenticator, Microsoft Authenticator or Authy. ' \
          'When you set up two factor authentication you will scan a QR ' \
          'code with your authenticator app, and it will generate a fresh ' \
          'six-digit code every thirty seconds.') %>
  </p>
</div>
